{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786908323946515001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"reportable-chalkstony-eeve","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"ce7f69bef9debb4ee7f6c92bad0028b75058aed53ee7c30f9400829d52459fc8","event_uuid":"242253f3-aff0-4bf5-aa86-8d8bedcee1eb","position":{"commit_sha":"53d353d06893097804a01ffe24077d6f73ed8447","position":"1786902599816908001-242253f3-aff0-4bf5-aa86-8d8bedcee1eb"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fdb24b68390d1ffb96cc7a338bb6d3d1a521f3ee31041ac3a27ff69c1ba4bd13","event_uuid":"ad596d5e-ffdb-44dd-9d44-31868dd35d48","position":{"commit_sha":"a1d384065631966ff8e931272fef295d44542940","position":"1786902609036889001-ad596d5e-ffdb-44dd-9d44-31868dd35d48"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"fd5839088fdc37e4de79cf573a4e7a112688231b63c083beee6140f62dc0410f","event_uuid":"b3472663-2df8-4726-a8d9-67fc233cc9db","position":{"commit_sha":"000764ebe96d3b0e89a485fb4a57eb6270cd7f0d","position":"1786902635815478001-b3472663-2df8-4726-a8d9-67fc233cc9db"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786902599816908001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"ad596d5e-ffdb-44dd-9d44-31868dd35d48","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"ee98-a2c0-7d12-4c75"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nClosing recovery ticket `irascible-clueless-basenji` after `set-file-impact --none` spent approximately five minutes in the deterministic work-landed precheck before succeeding. The ticket had `file_impact=[]` / `file_impact_scope=none`, no descendants, a signed PASS plan review, and a signed PASS completion verification. No commit was required or expected.\n\nThe hot path is unconditional in `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py`:\n- `_check_work_landed` calls `_referencing_commits(...)` before checking `field_reads.file_impact(...)` (current lines 219-220).\n- `_referencing_commits` reads the full `git log`, extracts every historical ticket reference, and calls `resolve_ticket_id(..., quiet=True)` for every unique reference (current lines 326-345).\n- During the reproduction, interruption showed the process inside `resolve_ticket_id -> _scan_alias -> json.load`, scanning tracker snapshots for an unrelated historical reference.\n\nThis work is unnecessary when neither the ticket nor any accepted descendant declares file impact: `_check_file_impact_vs_diff` already treats an empty union as out of scope. The current ordering turns an ordinary no-code close into a repository-history × ticket-resolution scan.\n\n## Proposed Plan\n- Add a cheap guard in `_check_work_landed` based on the union of file impact for the ticket and accepted descendants.\n- Return before `_referencing_commits` when that union is empty.\n- Preserve existing commit-presence and declared-impact-vs-diff enforcement when any in-scope file impact exists.\n- Add focused regression tests proving the no-impact path never invokes commit discovery and the impact-present path remains enforced.\n- Confirm the change does not alter administrative disposition, force, descendant-credit, or completion-verifier semantics.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Closing a ticket whose accepted ticket/descendant scope has no file impact does not call `_referencing_commits`.\n- [ ] A ticket or accepted descendant with file impact still runs referencing-commit discovery and existing landing checks.\n- [ ] Existing file-impact-vs-diff and descendant-credit tests remain green.\n- [ ] A regression test fails if full-history commit discovery is reintroduced on the empty-impact path.\n- [ ] The implementation preserves completion-verifier and administrative-disposition behavior.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py","reason":"Short-circuit commit-reference discovery when accepted scope has no declared file impact."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_attach_commits.py","reason":"Pin helper behavior so empty impact never invokes full-history commit discovery."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_gate_subtree.py","reason":"Preserve descendant impact and referencing-commit close semantics end to end."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["performance","completion-gate","discovered"],"ticket_id":"f380-19d4-4b2f-4bf8","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Close precheck scans all commit references when file impact is empty","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["242253f3-aff0-4bf5-aa86-8d8bedcee1eb","ad596d5e-ffdb-44dd-9d44-31868dd35d48","b3472663-2df8-4726-a8d9-67fc233cc9db"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786908323946515001,"uuid":"a7cd3bfc-55af-41a2-84cf-9f76e68fa887"}